---
import {locations} from '../data/storefront';
import Picture from './Picture.astro';
---
<section class="section wrap locations-section" id="locations"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">COLLECTION & DELIVERY</p><h2>Plan your handover.</h2></div><p class="section-description">Confirm your location and arrangements before you travel.</p></div>{locations.length?<div data-tabs><div role="tablist" aria-label="Collection locations" class="pill-tabs">{locations.map((l,i)=><button role="tab" id={`location-tab-${l.id}`} aria-controls={`location-${l.id}`} aria-selected={i===0} tabindex={i===0?0:-1}>{l.name}</button>)}</div>{locations.map((l,i)=><div role="tabpanel" id={`location-${l.id}`} aria-labelledby={`location-tab-${l.id}`} hidden={i!==0} class="location-panel"><Picture name={l.image} alt={l.name}/><div><h3>{l.name}</h3><p>{l.address}</p><a href={`tel:${l.phone.replace(/[^+0-9]/g,'')}`}>{l.phone}</a>{l.hours.map(h=><p>{h}</p>)}<a class="button" href={l.mapUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions →</a></div></div>)}</div>:<div class="location-panel"><Picture name="headquarters" alt="Car Trailers Australia headquarters concept"/><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR COLLECTION ARRANGEMENTS</p><h3>Start with your postcode.</h3><p>Request collection or delivery details for the trailer you are considering. Addresses, availability and timing are confirmed with your quote.</p><p class="muted">The building shown is a concept illustration.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button" href="/quote/?topic=collection">Ask about collection →</a><a class="text-link" href="/delivery/">Delivery information →</a></div></div></div>}</section>
